+/*
+RenderCellTree3D is a loose quadtree or loose octree: a part of a render
+tree that divides a region of the world into cells, each split into smaller
+cells as needed. QuadTree3D uses it without splitting the height, so each cell
+is a square column. Octree uses it splitting all three axes, so each cell is
+a cube.
