+RenderTree3D keeps track of where every drawable item in a 3D scene is, so
+that drawing and shadows only handle the items that matter. It answers these
+questions:
+
+- Which items can the camera see? (CollectVisible)
+- Which items could cast a shadow into one cascade of a directional light's
+  shadows? (CollectDirectionalShadowCasters)
+- Which items are within a point light's reach? (CollectPointShadowCasters)
+- Which items overlap a box or a sphere? (CollectInBox, CollectInSphere)
